  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rko 220.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide uniform procedures for the conduct of public comment hearings held pursuant to RSA 541-A:11.\n\nSource. #13921, eff 5-20-24",
